{"id":"h055","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"simpleqa","question":"What is the name of Nepal's first technical university that offers agricultural workforce development? Is the answer \"Agriculture and Forestry University\"?","truth":"yes","model_answer":"yes","correct":true,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"AFU was established in 2010 in Rampur, Chitwan.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.3,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"AFU is widely described as Nepal's first university dedicated to agriculture and forestry.","confidence":0.85,"lean":0.8,"theta":1.3352,"phi":0.0},{"text":"AFU's mandate is applied and vocational, aimed at building a skilled agricultural and forestry workforce.","confidence":0.85,"lean":0.7,"theta":1.3352,"phi":0.0},{"text":"No other Nepali institution is a strong competitor for the title of first technical university for agricultural workforce development.","confidence":0.7,"lean":0.7,"theta":1.0996,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The 'first technical university' label is not a formal designation that can be confirmed.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-0.5,"theta":0.9425,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The meaning of 'first' depends on how 'technical' is defined, and Nepal has several institutions with technical mandates.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-0.4,"theta":0.9425,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The Institute of Engineering and Madan Bhandari University of Science and Technology have technical missions but are not agriculture-specific.","confidence":0.75,"lean":-0.2,"theta":1.1781,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The question's features of agricultural workforce development and being first match AFU's profile, so the answer is yes.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.9,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0}],"relations":[{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":3,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":4,"J":-0.4,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":1,"j":5,"J":-0.5,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":1,"j":6,"J":-0.4,"relation":"contradicts"},